      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ok, I have reason to believe the solution exists in Unity and was occuring due to using Pumpkin Tools to copy over settings from one model to another and it was copying something over that is not good. That's all I can say. These are the settings that are working for me. The solution is this: #1. Copy over a working armature. #2. Ensure your pumkin tool settings are not copying things you don't need.",
